1070	     * relation the repetition crossed. The distinction decides the shape of a whole
1071	     * result, because a summary written over one of them summarises along the row
1072	     * rather than down the table — `min(e.line)` is the earliest line of this path,
1073	     * not of every path — and a projection made only of those keeps one row per match.
